    },
    "text": "<h1 class=\"font_0\" style=\"font-size:24px; text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#20CE88\"><span style=\"background-color:#4682B4\">Your ship washes onto a sandy beach. The group explores the island, and it quickly becomes clear that it&#39;s not very big... and it&#39;s uninhabited. Thankfully, you find what you need to survive. Namely: coconuts for sustenance, and palm huts for shelter. It&#39;s beautiful here, but man... after a few months, coconuts get really old... After a few years, they make you crazy.</span></span></span></h1>",
